34
00:01:24.703 --> 00:01:29.640
We looked back and we discovered Earth for the first time.

35
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.893
And there it was just-

36
00:01:30.893 --> 00:01:31.730
From that perspective.

37
00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:32.866
From that perspective.

38
00:01:32.866 --> 00:01:37.866
There it was just a drift in space in this void

39
