59
00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.450
That'd be kind of fun.

60
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.590
But I think the reasons why they want it are not,

61
00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:27.400
well-informed 'cause they wanna make sure

62
00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.040
