71
00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:52.120
If you have the power to turn Mars into Earth

72
00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.860
then you have the power to turn Earth back into Earth.

73
00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.478
That doesn't mean I don't wanna go to Mars.

74
00:02:56.478 --> 00:02:58.470
I'll go take a vacation there.

75
00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.720
