78
00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.800
I don't have any problems with that.

79
00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.070
But don't worry so much about it.

80
00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.561
You need somebody to keep the dream going.

81
00:03:11.561 --> 00:03:12.394
Yes.

82
00:03:12.394 --> 00:03:13.760
And one other point I wanna make,

83
00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.140 line:15%
